# PRIVATE (미방송분). JS4 (real scare, medium): the deck chews the tape and the monitor warps into the LINEAR picture (no flash).
# calm = the frame before, chew = the scare frame. linear.pal.
@palette ../palette/linear.pal
@size 320 180
@output ../cuts/ins_js4.png
@preview ../previews/ins_js4_x2.png 2
@columns 1

@frame calm





















































































































































































@frame chew




















































































































































































